# ACE Result Aggregation

1. Scan all `*_eval_log.txt` and `eval_summary_*.txt` in the experiment directory.
2. Use one explicit best-of aggregation rule.
3. Tie best metrics back to exact files and iterations.
4. Update or compare reference markdown tables with the same rule.
